# Exhibit G — Live Jobs (preserve exactly)

This feature is **not** in Vrushank’s UI drop. After pulling his files into a new repo, **rebuild Live Jobs as it exists in this conversation**. Do not replace it with DuckDuckGo `"minutes ago"` searches. Do not auto-DM LinkedIn/Naukri.

## Source of truth (copy these, then restyle to match new UI)

- `backend/services/live_jobs.py` — entire service (copy file as-is if it still exists)
- `backend/main.py` — import `live_jobs` and the Exhibit G routes below
